1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 9=

4
00:01:06,380 --> 00:01:07,520
I hope you won't
laugh at me, Your Highness.

5
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:18,780
Tingting steps gracefully
[*Tingting: a pun on graceful poise]

6
00:01:18,780 --> 00:01:19,810
from behind the gauze curtains,
[*Tingting: a pun on graceful poise]

7
00:01:19,810 --> 00:01:21,230
her beauty captivating every eye.

8
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:22,480
You

9
00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:24,120
must be Mu Tingting.

10
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:30,120
Greetings, Your Highness.

11
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:38,510
Your Highness,
during the Lantern Festival,

12
00:01:38,510 --> 00:01:39,510
you left the palace in disguise.

13
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:41,840
I assume you're here to see
how the people are faring.

14
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:44,120
There's plenty to enjoy outside.

15
00:01:44,310 --> 00:01:45,590
- Why don't we go outside
- Fu Yang.

16
00:01:46,510 --> 00:01:47,310
and take the opportunity

17
00:01:47,490 --> 00:01:48,530
to join the people in the festivities?

18
00:01:49,510 --> 00:01:50,230
Yes, let's!

19
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,680
Then let's hurry out and have some fun.

20
00:01:52,150 --> 00:01:52,840
Come on, Yuan Yuan.

21
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,120
Miss Mu, why don't you

22
00:01:54,870 --> 00:01:56,070
come with us?

23
00:01:58,590 --> 00:01:59,350
May I?

24
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,710
Candied hawthorns!

25
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:19,280
Yuan Yuan, candied hawthorns!

26
00:02:25,590 --> 00:02:26,080
Yuan Yuan!

27
00:02:26,710 --> 00:02:28,080
Candied hawthorns!

28
00:02:31,990 --> 00:02:32,740
Miss, have a look.

29
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,030
Fragrance sachets!

30
00:02:34,870 --> 00:02:36,800
This lantern is so beautiful.

31
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:40,280
Come have a look! Fragrance sachets!

32
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:47,680
Come take a look!

33
00:02:47,810 --> 00:02:49,610
Hand-embroidered fragrance sachets!

34
00:02:51,190 --> 00:02:52,000
Where are they?

35
00:02:57,030 --> 00:02:58,520
No, there are too many people here.

36
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:00,120
Those two girls are on their own.

37
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:01,240
They could be in danger.

38
00:03:01,750 --> 00:03:02,630
Let's split up and look for them.

39
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:04,470
Come take a look!

40
00:03:07,190 --> 00:03:08,630
Excuse me!

41
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,400
Young lady,

42
00:03:16,770 --> 00:03:17,850
it must be lonely walking by yourself.

43
00:03:18,590 --> 00:03:21,030
How about I enjoy the lanterns with you?

44
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:23,800
How dare you!

45
00:03:23,980 --> 00:03:24,780
What do you think you're doing?

46
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,030
This is rather interesting.

47
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:28,190
What do you think I want?

48
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:29,680
I like you.

49
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:34,000
My wife is shy around strangers.

50
00:03:34,030 --> 00:03:34,430
Sir,

51
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:36,000
please behave yourself.

52
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:40,910
Come take a look!

53
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:45,590
Let's go.

54
00:03:49,070 --> 00:03:49,630
Look!

55
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,800
It's so lively!

56
00:03:52,190 --> 00:03:53,150
Let's go take a look over there.

57
00:03:53,150 --> 00:03:54,190
Come on!

58
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,030
Follow me.

59
00:04:26,870 --> 00:04:27,390
Fu Yang.

60
00:04:27,630 --> 00:04:29,070
What did you just call me?

61
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:30,480
Wife?

62
00:04:32,270 --> 00:04:33,240
It was only a temporary measure.

63
00:04:33,580 --> 00:04:34,700
Forgive me for the offense,
Your Highness.

64
00:04:40,070 --> 00:04:41,120
What if, of all the people in the world,

65
00:04:41,190 --> 00:04:42,390
you're the only one
I'll allow to offend me?

66
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,870
When you saved me just now,

67
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,430
I already saw it.

68
00:04:55,750 --> 00:04:57,480
On this Lantern Festival,

69
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,510
a golden hairpin for a beautiful lady.

70
00:05:00,510 --> 00:05:01,070
Fu Yang,

71
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,190
this hairpin...

72
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:04,040
Were you planning to give it to me?

73
00:05:06,310 --> 00:05:07,430
I'll count to three.

74
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:09,390
If you don't answer,
I'll take that as a yes.

75
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:11,240
One.

76
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:13,600
Two, three.

77
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:16,480
It's mine now.

78
00:05:19,630 --> 00:05:21,680
Since you've given it to me,
you can't take it back.

79
00:05:24,950 --> 00:05:25,510
Fu Yang,

80
00:05:26,870 --> 00:05:28,160
I want you, three days from now,

81
00:05:28,630 --> 00:05:30,120
to ask my mother
for permission to marry me.

82
00:05:30,830 --> 00:05:31,870
If you don't come,

83
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,720
I'll never bother you again.

84
00:05:36,770 --> 00:05:40,880
♪My thoughts
of you linger by the window♪

85
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:42,270
Your Highness, rest here for a while.

86
00:05:43,430 --> 00:05:44,480
I'll go find He Xiaoyuan.

87
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:50,380
♪Green glazed hues,
red strokes of the brush♪

88
00:05:51,690 --> 00:05:56,830
♪The pages hold a heart steadfast
from beginning to end♪

89
00:05:56,950 --> 00:05:57,600
He Xiaoyuan,

90
00:05:57,750 --> 00:05:58,600
have you lost your mind?

91
00:05:59,190 --> 00:06:00,630
Why did you invite Mu Tingting along?

92
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:03,630
You planted spies to keep track
of the Crown Prince

93
00:06:03,770 --> 00:06:05,070
and learned that he was coming
to the pleasure house,

94
00:06:05,070 --> 00:06:05,920
so you planned to get here first

95
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:07,040
and keep the two of them from meeting.

96
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:07,680
Unfortunately,

97
00:06:08,070 --> 00:06:09,270
they still met.

98
00:06:09,630 --> 00:06:10,430
Zhao Boqing,

99
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,800
if I hadn't brought
Mu Tingting out with us,

100
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:13,720
would she

101
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,120
already be dead by now?

102
00:06:15,270 --> 00:06:16,680
Sometimes I truly don't know
whether to call you foolish

103
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:17,630
or clever.

104
00:06:17,630 --> 00:06:19,120
If you figured it out,
why did you stop me?

105
00:06:19,190 --> 00:06:20,510
Because she hasn't done anything wrong.

106
00:06:20,630 --> 00:06:21,480
The Crown Prince likes her.

107
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,510
That's not her fault.

108
00:06:22,510 --> 00:06:24,120
You're killing an innocent person.

109
00:06:24,270 --> 00:06:25,120
He Xiaoyuan,

110
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,830
nothing you say now
will make a difference.

111
00:06:26,830 --> 00:06:28,190
I won't allow anyone

112
00:06:28,190 --> 00:06:29,510
to ruin my plans.

113
00:06:31,270 --> 00:06:32,430
Is the fact that I like you

114
00:06:33,830 --> 00:06:35,720
also getting in the way of your plans?

115
00:06:36,630 --> 00:06:38,270
What does that
have to do with you liking me?

116
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:41,160
Stop.

117
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,720
If you dare kill Mu Tingting,

118
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,750
I'll take my own life
right now and start over.

119
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,430
He Xiaoyuan,

120
00:06:52,070 --> 00:06:53,870
how long are you going
to let compassion cloud your judgment?

121
00:06:53,950 --> 00:06:54,720
Don't you understand?

122
00:06:54,870 --> 00:06:56,480
As long as
Mu Tingting alone is sacrificed,

123
00:06:56,870 --> 00:06:57,870
no one will be able to threaten

124
00:06:57,870 --> 00:06:58,920
your position as Crown Princess.

125
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:01,240
In exchange, the realm can enjoy peace

126
00:07:01,270 --> 00:07:02,270
and the nation can prosper.

127
00:07:03,390 --> 00:07:04,630
How easy it is to say,
"sacrifice one person."

128
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:07,270
Who would willingly become
a sacrifice for your grand plans?

129
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:09,720
The realm, power,
and position you seek to protect,

130
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:10,750
aren't they all

131
00:07:10,750 --> 00:07:12,360
made up of countless individuals?

132
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:17,390
Fine.

133
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:19,390
You win.

134
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,720
I won't kill her.

135
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,000
Satisfied?

136
00:07:22,190 --> 00:07:22,750
But

137
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:27,160
as for your feelings for me,

138
00:07:27,270 --> 00:07:28,680
bury them deep
and never speak of them again.

139
00:07:30,040 --> 00:07:31,270
We belong to different worlds.

140
00:07:34,630 --> 00:07:35,510
Go find the Crown Prince.

141
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:48,870
Mother, wake up! Mother!

142
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:57,120
Mother!

143
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:26,680
Don't be afraid.

144
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,560
He Xiaoyuan.

145
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,440
Watch out!

146
00:08:41,870 --> 00:08:42,550
He Xiaoyuan!

147
00:08:45,790 --> 00:08:46,360
Murder!

148
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:46,960
Wait here for me.

149
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:48,510
Murder!

150
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,030
- Hurry!
- Go!

151
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:52,000
- Murder!
- Murder!

152
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:52,630
- Hurry!
- Go!

153
00:09:17,670 --> 00:09:18,200
Quick.

154
00:09:18,630 --> 00:09:19,630
Run toward the south alley.

155
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,630
On your left,

156
00:09:20,910 --> 00:09:22,030
turn right at the third fork.

157
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,600
It's the house with a well.

158
00:09:23,630 --> 00:09:23,910
All right.

159
00:09:33,790 --> 00:09:34,390
He Xiaoyuan,

160
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:35,910
hold on.

161
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:46,000
Consider my childhood debt

162
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,390
to you repaid.

163
00:09:49,030 --> 00:09:49,910
Who asked you to repay me?

164
00:09:51,030 --> 00:09:52,150
Your life belongs to me.

165
00:09:52,790 --> 00:09:53,790
If I won't let you die,

166
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:55,030
then you absolutely cannot die.

167
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:58,030
You're the one I love.

168
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:03,480
I never wanted
to pursue Zhao Junyao at all.

169
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:06,480
In the next life...

170
00:10:13,510 --> 00:10:14,200
He Xiaoyuan!

171
00:10:16,670 --> 00:10:17,360
He Xiaoyuan!

172
00:10:20,970 --> 00:10:26,240
♪One thought waits for the snow,
shining bright in my memories♪

173
00:10:26,270 --> 00:10:26,960
Quick!

174
00:10:27,390 --> 00:10:29,510
Be good and take this. Hurry!

175
00:10:30,390 --> 00:10:33,620
♪With no regrets for this chapter♪

176
00:10:34,010 --> 00:10:40,630
♪Can I still hope that someday
we'll meet again?♪

177
00:10:48,150 --> 00:10:48,720
He Xiaoyuan.

178
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:50,120
He Xiaoyuan.

179
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,030
Wake up.

180
00:10:52,790 --> 00:10:53,670
If you don't wake up,

181
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:56,670
I'll have your parents join you.

182
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:57,960
I mean it.

183
00:11:00,910 --> 00:11:01,600
He Xiaoyuan.

184
00:11:06,550 --> 00:11:08,030
What can you do

185
00:11:09,270 --> 00:11:10,670
besides threaten me?

186
00:11:11,510 --> 00:11:12,320
Yes.

187
00:11:12,910 --> 00:11:14,030
That's how despicable I am.

188
00:11:15,390 --> 00:11:16,720
So you're not allowed to die.

189
00:11:23,150 --> 00:11:23,840
If you die,

190
00:11:25,630 --> 00:11:27,870
who will be the one variable
in this game of mine?

191
00:11:28,510 --> 00:11:30,080
Who will annoy me and make me angry?

192
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:31,510
He Xiaoyuan,

193
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,270
I have feelings for you.

194
00:11:37,510 --> 00:11:38,600
So please,

195
00:11:39,390 --> 00:11:41,030
please stay alive.

196
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,600
What did you say?

197
00:11:48,790 --> 00:11:49,600
Only in this lifetime

198
00:11:51,030 --> 00:11:52,870
have I finally understood my own heart.

199
00:11:54,030 --> 00:11:55,150
I'm in love with you.

200
00:11:56,380 --> 00:11:57,580
It has nothing to do with the Crown Prince

201
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,510
or the fate of the realm.

202
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:01,870
Please,

203
00:12:03,270 --> 00:12:04,320
don't leave me.

204
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,440
How do you feel?

205
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:55,910
Is this my final burst of life?

206
00:12:57,870 --> 00:12:59,270
Before people die,

207
00:13:00,670 --> 00:13:03,030
can they really see the person
they most want to see?

208
00:13:05,030 --> 00:13:05,750
Your Highness.

209
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:09,270
I'm so happy

210
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:12,390
I get to see you before I die.

211
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:14,910
Then I can help you find out

212
00:13:15,670 --> 00:13:16,910
whether you're still alive.

213
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:55,440
Do you still think

214
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:58,120
this is your final burst of life?

215
00:14:05,910 --> 00:14:07,630
I must be dead.

216
00:14:11,150 --> 00:14:12,480
Silly He.

217
00:14:25,300 --> 00:14:27,620
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

218
00:14:27,980 --> 00:14:29,660
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

219
00:14:30,300 --> 00:14:33,300
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

220
00:14:33,820 --> 00:14:38,140
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

221
00:14:38,140 --> 00:14:40,900
♪My heart has long known♪

222
00:14:41,340 --> 00:14:43,340
♪We made a promise long ago♪

223
00:14:43,660 --> 00:14:45,260
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

224
00:14:45,940 --> 00:14:49,260
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

225
00:14:49,580 --> 00:14:52,420
♪How much must I let go♪

226
00:14:52,740 --> 00:14:54,420
♪For one moment♪

227
00:14:54,700 --> 00:14:57,420
♪To hold each other close♪

228
00:14:57,660 --> 00:15:01,980
♪Would that be enough?♪
